# Contract authorization baseline.
#
# One line per exported contract method. After each, state who may call it.
# Reviewed entries look like:
#   crates/x/src/state.rs:debit    owner-allowlisted settlement contracts only
#   crates/x/src/state.rs:get_info PUBLIC — read-only, leaks no session data
#
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:approve	PUBLIC — caller must be committee member with valid BLS sig over digest
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:epoch	PUBLIC — read-only scalar
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:finalize	PUBLIC — permissionless when the proposal account is still authorized (require_authorized) and quorum is met; delay 0 call_raw, else queue
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:execute	PUBLIC — permissionless when queued, still authorized (require_authorized), and execute_at reached
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:cancel	PUBLIC — current committee quorum BLS over cancel_proposal_message_v1
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:init_data	contract owner, direct account call (require_direct_owner)
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:init_registry	contract owner, direct account call (require_direct_owner)
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:next_proposal_id	PUBLIC — read-only scalar
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:proposal	PUBLIC — read-only view
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:proposal_ttl	PUBLIC — read-only scalar
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:propose	PUBLIC — anyone, but only the authorized registry account (require_authorized); digest uniqueness + epoch/deadline enforced on-chain
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:prune	PUBLIC — permissionless batch (max 128 records examined per map)
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:set_authorized_account	contract owner, direct account call (require_direct_owner)
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:set_proposal_ttl	contract owner, direct account call (require_direct_owner)
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:set_tombstone	contract owner, direct account call (require_direct_owner)
crates/knot-proposals/src/state.rs:status	PUBLIC — read-only scalar
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:chain_id	PUBLIC — test-only read-only host probe
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:configure_reenter	PUBLIC — test-only reentrancy fixture
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:fail_set	PUBLIC — test-only intentional panic
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:forward_set_ttl	PUBLIC — test-only; forwards set_proposal_ttl so an owner transaction is not a direct call
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:gated_set	PUBLIC — test-only; panics unless caller is the proposals contract
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:hit_count	PUBLIC — test-only read-only counter
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:set_value	PUBLIC — test-only mutator
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:set_value_reenter_finalize	PUBLIC — test-only reentrancy mutator
crates/knot-proposals/test-target/src/lib.rs:value	PUBLIC — test-only read-only scalar
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:account	PUBLIC — read-only view (may be None on testnet free-read)
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:change_account	PUBLIC — current committee quorum BLS over change_account_message_v3; delay 0 applies in-call
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:set_timelock	PUBLIC — current committee quorum BLS over set_timelock_message_v1
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:cancel_pending	PUBLIC — current committee quorum BLS over cancel_pending_message_v1
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:execute_pending	PUBLIC — permissionless after execute_at
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:create_account	PUBLIC — anyone may register a committee
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:init_data	contract owner, direct account call (require_direct_owner)
crates/knot-registry/src/state.rs:next_account_id	PUBLIC — read-only scalar
