crates/knot-registry-data/src/state.rs:clear_pending	Atlas-resolved knot-registry logic only (require_logic_caller)
crates/knot-registry-data/src/state.rs:create_account	Atlas-resolved knot-registry logic only (require_logic_caller)
crates/knot-registry-data/src/state.rs:execute_pending	Atlas-resolved knot-registry logic only (require_logic_caller)
